I would make this a first-class LeaseOS subsystem, not bury it inside dispatch. Dispatch, safety, billing, TDG, job history and the AI secretary would all consume the same contact service.

And I would make one rule non-negotiable in the implementation:

> No API is allowed to return a phone number merely because the caller can see the person. It must separately authorize that specific contact method for that user, organization, job and purpose.



That single design choice will prevent a lot of privacy leakage later.

